# Layout

The shared shell every page extends: a header with a nav whose current link is marked
`active`, and a footer every page inherits.

## Component Site

View:
    <header>
      <nav>
        <a id="nav-home" href="/" class:active={routePath() is equal to "/"}>Home</a>
        <a id="nav-about" href="/about" class:active={routePath() is equal to "/about"}>About</a>
        <a id="nav-writing" href="/writing" class:active={routePath() is equal to "/writing"}>Writing</a>
        <a id="nav-contact" href="/contact" class:active={routePath() is equal to "/contact"}>Contact</a>
      </nav>
    </header>
    <main>{block content}</main>
    <footer>&copy; Acme</footer>

Style:
    nav { display: flex; gap: 1rem; }
    nav a.active { font-weight: 700; text-decoration: underline; }
